                    <div class="history__item"><dt class="history__year">2020</dt><dd><p class="history__month">May</p><p class="history__txt">Started exports to Japan</p></dd></div>
                    <div class="history__item"><dt class="history__year">2020</dt><dd><p class="history__month">Jun</p><p class="history__txt">Started exports to Mexico</p></dd></div>
                    <div class="history__item"><dt class="history__year">2020</dt><dd><p class="history__month">Oct</p><p class="history__txt">Started exports to China</p></dd></div>
                    <div class="history__item history__item--award"><dt class="history__year">2021</dt><dd><p class="history__month">Jun</p><div class="award-card"><div class="award-card__body"><p class="award-card__title">DENSO Collaboration Award 2021</p><p class="award-card__sub">Excellence in Partnership & Supply Chain</p><p class="award-card__desc">In 2021, MICROTECHNO VIETNAM was honored with the DENSO Collaboration Award, recognizing our effective partnership and positive contributions to manufacturing operations and supply chain development.</p><p class="award-card__desc">The award stands as a testament to the strong partnership between MICROTECHNO VIETNAM and DENSO, affirming our collaborative spirit and commitment to delivering lasting value together.</p></div><figure class="award-card__img"><img src="/images/5.png" alt="DENSO Collaboration Award 2021" loading="lazy"></figure></div></dd></div>
                    <div class="history__item"><dt class="history__year">2022</dt><dd><p class="history__month"></p><p class="history__txt">Started G4 production implementation</p></dd></div>
                    <div class="history__item history__item--award"><dt class="history__year">2024</dt><dd><p class="history__month">Jun</p><div class="award-card"><div class="award-card__body"><p class="award-card__title">DENSO Quality Contribution Award 2024</p><p class="award-card__sub">Outstanding Quality & Supply Chain Reliability</p><p class="award-card__desc">At the DENSO Supplier Conference 2025, MICROTECHNO VIETNAM received the Quality Contribution Award 2024 for outstanding contributions to product quality improvement and supply chain reliability.</p><p class="award-card__desc">The award reflects our customer's recognition of our quality management system, risk control capabilities, and commitment to meeting the stringent requirements of the automotive industry.</p></div><figure class="award-card__img"><img src="/images/3.png" alt="DENSO Quality Contribution Award 2024" loading="lazy"></figure></div></dd></div>
                    <div class="history__item history__item--award"><dt class="history__year">2025</dt><dd><p class="history__month">Jun</p><div class="award-card"><div class="award-card__body"><p class="award-card__title">Preferred Supplier Certification 2025</p><p class="award-card__sub">Preferred Supplier — Sasaki Group, Japan</p><p class="award-card__desc">In 2025, MICROTECHNO VIETNAM was once again recognized as a Preferred Supplier by Sasaki Group (Japan), demonstrating our sustained capability to maintain consistent quality and meet the rigorous production and management standards of our Japanese customer.</p><p class="award-card__desc">This certification, maintained since our first recognition in 2021, reflects the long-term trust our partner has placed in our manufacturing competency, quality control systems, and commitment to continuous improvement.</p></div><figure class="award-card__img"><img src="/images/1.png" alt="Sasaki Preferred Supplier 2025" loading="lazy"></figure></div></dd></div>
                    <div class="history__item history__item--award"><dt class="history__year">2025</dt><dd><p class="history__month">Jun</p><div class="award-card"><div class="award-card__body"><p class="award-card__title">DENSO Excellent Cost Award 2025</p><p class="award-card__sub">Excellence in Operational Efficiency & Cost Optimization</p><p class="award-card__desc">MICROTECHNO VIETNAM is proud to receive the Excellent Cost Award 2025 from DENSO — one of the world's leading automotive parts manufacturers.</p><p class="award-card__desc">The award recognizes our outstanding efforts in optimizing manufacturing processes, improving operational efficiency, and reducing costs while maintaining world-class product quality standards. It is a result of our continuous improvement mindset (Kaizen) and close collaboration across all departments.</p></div><figure class="award-card__img"><img src="/images/2.png" alt="DENSO Excellent Cost Award 2025" loading="lazy"></figure></div></dd></div>
                    <div class="history__item history__item--award"><dt class="history__year">2026</dt><dd><p class="history__month">Jun</p><div class="award-card"><div class="award-card__body"><p class="award-card__title">MAZDA MPMT Continuous Quality Supplier Award (3 Years)</p><p class="award-card__sub">Contribution to Zero-Defect Quality — Sakuma (Thailand)</p><p class="award-card__desc">In June 2026, Sakuma (Thailand) Co., Ltd received the MAZDA MPMT Continuous Quality Supplier Award (3 consecutive years) for achieving "0" defect on the 2024 purchased part quality for Mazda Powertrain Manufacturing Thailand.</p><p class="award-card__desc">Sakuma (Thailand) expressed sincere appreciation to MICROTECHNO VIETNAM for its valuable support and contribution, which played an important role in this achievement — a testament to our quality control capabilities and partnership.</p></div><figure class="award-card__img"><img src="/images/7.png" alt="MAZDA MPMT Continuous Quality Supplier Award — Sakuma (Thailand) / MICROTECHNO VIETNAM" loading="lazy"></figure></div></dd></div>
                    <div class="history__item history__item--award"><dt class="history__year">2026</dt><dd><p class="history__month">Jun</p><div class="award-card"><div class="award-card__body"><p class="award-card__title">DENSO Overall Outstanding Award 2026</p><p class="award-card__sub">Overall Excellence Across All Evaluation Criteria</p><p class="award-card__desc">On 26 June 2026, MICROTECHNO VIETNAM was honored with the Overall Outstanding Award 2026 from DENSO — the highest overall recognition granted to suppliers achieving excellence across every evaluation criterion.</p><p class="award-card__desc">The award recognizes our comprehensive performance in quality, cost, delivery, and collaboration. It is the culmination of years of continuous improvement and steadfast partnership with our customers.</p></div><figure class="award-card__img"><img src="/images/8.png" alt="DENSO Overall Outstanding Award 2026" loading="lazy"></figure></div></dd></div>
                }
            </dl>
